7009\">248707009</a><i>(sans précision de cause)</i></td><td><span title=\"SOURCEISNARROWERTHANTARGET\">&lt;</span>T82.8</td><td><span title=\"EQUIVALENT\">~</span><a href=\"CodeSystem-ipccc.html#ipccc-15.4650.4678\">15.50.78</a></td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-taussig-adverse-event.html#taussig-adverse-event-TAUSSIG-AE-0036\">TAUSSIG-AE-0036</a></td><td>Compression coronaire après implantation de dispositif transluminal</td><td/><td><span title=\"SOURCEISNARROWERTHANTARGET\">&lt;</span>T82.5</td><td><span title=\"EQUIVALENT\">~</span><a href=\"CodeSystem-ipccc.html#ipccc-15.4650.4661\">15.50.61</a></td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-taussig-adverse-event.html#taussig-adverse-event-TAUSSIG-AE-0037\">TAUSSIG-AE-0037</a></td><td>Stent laissé déployé en position non prévue après migration ou embolisation</td><td><span title=\"SOURCEISNARROWERTHANTARGET\">&lt;</span><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/473125002\">473125002</a><i>(migration)</i></td><td><span title=\"SOURCEISNARROWERTHANTARGET\">&lt;</span>T82.5</td><td><span title=\"EQUIVALENT\">~</span><a href=\"CodeSystem-ipccc.html#ipccc-15.4650.4691\">15.50.91</a></td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-taussig-adverse-event.html#taussig-adverse-event-TAUSSIG-AE-0039\">TAUSSIG-AE-0039</a></td><td>Embolisation (délogement) d'un coil introduit par cathéter</td><td><span title=\"RELATEDTO\">?</span><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/473163005\">473163005</a><i>(fragment de dispositif ; un coil entier n'est pas un fragment)</i></td><td><span title=\"SOURCEISNARROWERTHANTARGET\">&lt;</span>T82.8</td><td><span title=\"EQUIVALENT\">~</span><a href=\"CodeSystem-ipccc.html#ipccc-15.4650.4665\">15.50.65</a></td><td><span title=\"SOURCEISNARROWERTHANTARGET\">&lt;</span><a href=\"CodeSystem-echsa.html#echsa-CP-2019-IC-11\">CP-2019-IC-11</a><i>(embolisation de dispositif)</i></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-taussig-adverse-event.html#taussig-adverse-event-TAUSSIG-AE-0040\">TAUSSIG-AE-0040</a></td><td>Thrombo